lid HSBC Taj Credit Cards issued in India only (\\u0026#8216;Card\\u0026#8217;) shall be eligible for the below Offer, valid from 1 August 2026 to 30 September 2026.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u0026#10;\\u0026#10; \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eOffer Construct:\\u003c/b\\u003e HSBC Taj cardholders will earn Instant Discount on spends on select Apple product purchases via the \\u003cb\\u003eHSBC Unicorn Portal\\u003c/b\\u003e for Instant EMI transactions only. Applicable discount is stated as per below table\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u0026#10;\\u0026#10; \\u003ctable border=\\\"1\\\" cellpadding=\\\"8\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cthead\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cth bgcolor=\\\"#db0011\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eProduct\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/th\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cth bgcolor=\\\"#db0011\\\"\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDiscount\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/th\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/thead\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctbody\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eAirpods\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPad\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone 17 Pro\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone 15\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone 16\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone 17\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone 17 Pro Max\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e5%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiPhone Air\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e19%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eMacbook\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e7%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003eiWatch\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003ctd align=\\\"center\\\"\\u003e4%\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/tbody\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/table\\u003e\\u0026#10;\\u0026#10; \\u003ch2\\u003eTerms and Conditions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003col\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis offer is valid till September 30, 2026, 11:59 PM.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis Offer is applicable only when purchases are completed via the HSBC Unicorn Portal. The Offer is not applicable for purchases made directly at the Unicorn website or any of Unicorn's offline store.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe Offer is applicable for Instant EMI transactions.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eDiscount will be valid for two products per card per month.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis is applicable on select Apple Products (list given below). The product shall be delivered within 10 days from the date of successful transactions.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eAll eligible products will be made available on the best effort basis. In case the product is out of stock , Unicorn will make best effort to make it available as soon as possible considering supply conditions.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eProcessing fee of \\u0026#8377;99 will be charged by the bank on successful conversion on transaction to Instant EMI.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eHSBC reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to add, alter, modify, all or any of these terms and conditions or replace, wholly or in part, this offer by any other offer, without prior notice or withdraw it altogether.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eTwo offers cannot be clubbed together (Accelerated Rewards and Instant EMI).\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eOffer is applicable on Indian Issued Cards \\u0026amp; INR(\\u0026#8377;) transactions only.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe offer with Unicorn is applicable only on the INR transactions (Indian Issued Cards) made with the HSBC Unicorn portal. Transactions made on a currency other than INR will not be applicable for this program.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eHSBC is solely liable to provide reward point to eligible customers.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eONLY 2 PRODUCTS PURCHASE IS ALLOWED PER CARD PER MONTH UNDER THIS OFFER.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis offer shall be governed by the laws of India. Any disputes arising out of and in connection with this offer shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Mumbai.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eFor any customer complaints, customer may contact on the below.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; Phone Number - \\u003cb\\u003e18002677888\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; Email ID - \\u003ca href=\\\"mailto:unicornsupport@unicornstore.in\\\"\\u003eunicornsupport@unicornstore.in\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; Phone Number - \\u003cb\\u003e7208835211\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; Unicorn shall respond to all customer complaints within 72 working hours\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026#10; working hours - 10 AM to 6 PM from Monday to Friday)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eFor any customer complaints related to reward points, customer to contact HSBC - \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.hsbc.co.in/help/\\\"\\u003eContact Us | Help and Support - HSBC IN\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003c/ol\\u003e\\u0026#10;\\u0026#10; \\u003ch2\\u003eGeneral Terms and Conditions\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003col\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis offer (\\u0026#8220;Offer\\u0026#8221;) is provided by The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation Limited, India (\\u0026#8220;Bank\\u0026#8221;) and Unicorn.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThese Offer terms and conditions (\\u0026#8220;Offer Terms\\u0026#8221;) are in addition to the Unicorn Conditions of Use \\u0026amp; Sale and Privacy Notice to which you agree to by using Unicorn Products and Terms \\u0026amp; Conditions of HSBC Credit Cards. In the event of any conflict between the Conditions of Use \\u0026amp; Sale and these Offer Terms, these Offer Terms will prevail, only for the purposes of this Offer.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eAll residents of India holding HSBC Taj Credit Card issued by the Bank are eligible to avail the Offer (each a \\u0026#8220;Cardholder\\u0026#8221;).\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eUnicorn and/or the Bank reserve the right to disqualify the Cardholder from the benefits of the Offer if any fraudulent activity is identified as being carried out for the purpose of availing the benefits under the said Offer or otherwise by use of the Card.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eHSBC will continue to charge interest as applicable for Instant EMI transactions where part or full interest charged by HSBC is refunded by merchant / brand / Unicorn. However, this interest charge will be provided to Cardholders as an upfront discount by the merchant / brand / Unicorn as communicated to the Cardholders at the time of the purchase, effectively giving the benefit of interest refund / interest subvention offer. GST on Interest and Processing fee on Instant EMI loans is borne by Cardholders in case of such transactions also. Please do read the merchant/Unicorn Offer Terms and Conditions carefully.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe amount of interest refund / interest subvention may vary for select products (\\u0026#8220;Products\\u0026#8221;) and may not be available on certain products as determined by seller/Unicorn. Cardholders are required to check the Offer applicability on the product page before making the due payment through their Card.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe discount amount offered will not be settled in cash under any circumstances whatsoever.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe Offer is not applicable on 'Cash on Delivery' payment by Cardholder.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis Offer will not be applicable if the Cardholder or the seller or Unicorn cancels the order and/or the Cardholder returns the product. In such scenarios, only the net amount paid by the Cardholder would be refunded. In other words the instant discount will not be retained.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eCardholder needs to inform HSBC to cancel the IEMI loan facility. Processing Fees will not be refunded as bank incurs effort and fees paid to payment agreegators for EMI transactions.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eUnicorn and/ or the Bank reserve the right, at any time, without prior notice and without assigning any reason whatsoever, to add/alter/modify/change or vary any or all of these Offer Terms or to replace, wholly or in part, this Offer by another offer, whether similar to this Offer or not, or to extend or withdraw it altogether.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eDelinquent and over-limit Bank\\u0026#8217;s credit card members will not qualify for this Offer. Cardholders are not bound in any way to participate in this Offer.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eAny participation is voluntary and the Offer is being made purely on a best effort basis.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eNothing herein amounts to a commitment by the Bank or Unicorn to conduct further, similar or other offers.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThe above Offer is by way of a special offer and nothing contained herein will prejudice or affect the terms and conditions of the Card member agreement. The terms of the above schemes will be in addition to and not in derogation of the terms contained in the Card member agreement.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis Offer is not valid on corporate or commercial Cards.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eBy participating in this Offer, every Cardholder expressly agrees that Bank and Unicorn will not be liable or responsible for any loss or damage whatsoever that a Cardholder may suffer, directly or indirectly, in connection with the Offer including but not limited to that associated with his/ her use or delivery or misuse of the Product(s). Bank shall not be liable for delivery, service, suitability, availability or quality of the products offered under this offer.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eAny person availing this Offer will be deemed to have accepted these Offer Terms.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eHSBC does not endorse any of the products or brands being Offered on Unicorn and does not provide any warranties or representations of the quality, saleability, suitability, or availability of products. Any dispute regarding such products must be addressed in writing by the Cardholder directly to Unicorn or respective merchants.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003eThis document is an electronic record in terms of the Information Technology Act, 2000, and the rules thereunder as applicable and the amended provisions pertaining to electronic records in various statutes as amended by the Information Technology Act, 2000. This electronic record is generated by a computer system and does not require any physical or digital signatures.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0026#10; \\u003cli\\u003